Gridlock and atomic rescue:
# Every gross transfer is blocked, but the whole cycle nets to zero.
currency HKD decimals 2;
account A HKD 10.00;
account B HKD 10.00;
account C HKD 10.00;
pay ab A -> B 15.00 HKD;
pay bc B -> C 15.00 HKD;
pay ca C -> A 15.00 HKD;
settle ab;
settle bc;
settle ca;
net rescue { ab, bc, ca };
assert total HKD 30.00;

Find the feasible order:
# ab must wait for ba, despite being declared first.
currency HKD decimals 2;
account A HKD 0.00;
account B HKD 20.00;
pay ab A -> B 12.00 HKD;
pay ba B -> A 15.00 HKD;
settle ab;
settle ba;
settle ab;
assert total HKD 20.00;

Currency type error:
# The compiler rejects implicit currency conversion before execution.
currency HKD decimals 2;
currency USD decimals 2;
account HongKong HKD 100.00;
account NewYork USD 100.00;
pay cross HongKong -> NewYork 10.00 HKD;

Exact decimal accounting:
currency HKD decimals 2;
account A HKD 0.30;
account B HKD 0.00;
pay ten A -> B 0.10 HKD;
pay twenty A -> B 0.20 HKD;
settle ten;
settle twenty;
